      "type": "text",
      "text": "Ethambutol 15–25 mg/kg (max 2.5 g) PO daily; best tolerated. Main toxicity optic neuritis (higher doses, renal impairment); first sign is blue-green color confusion. Baseline color vision and acuity, then monthly questioning; usually avoided in young children who can't read eye charts. Safe in pregnancy."
     }
